OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers protest against plans
OL,4,Afor 280 homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 50 people have gathered to
OL,7,Fprotest against plans to build up to
OL,8,F280 homes in an East Sussex village.
OL,10,FVillagers said they were concerned
OL,11,Fabout flooding in Hellingly, as well as
OL,12,Fextra pressure on the sewage network,
OL,13,Fmore traffic and the impact on the
OL,14,Frural landscape.
OL,16,FThe area, near Hailsham, often floods
OL,17,Fin the winter from the Cuckmere River
OL,18,Fand its tributary the Bull River.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
