OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers protest against plans
OL,4,Afor 280 homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FApplicant Hallam Land Management said
OL,7,Fits plans were supported by detailed
OL,8,Ftechnical assessments covering issues
OL,9,Fraised by residents, including flooding
OL,10,Fand drainage, highways, ecology and
OL,11,Flandscape.
